flowchart TB
  subgraph current[Implemented V3 browser system]
    ui[app.js and HTML CSS] --> model[model.js state validation and week operations]
    ui --> engine[engine.js eligibility ranking planning groceries]
    model --> engine
    ui --> catalog[catalog.json illustrative recipes and products]
    ui <--> storage[Origin-specific localStorage]
    store[Static host] --> ui
  end
  subgraph reference[Optional local reference - not called by browser]
    server[scripts serve.py loopback static and API] --> py[scripts recommender.py]
    py --> catalog
    checks[Domain and state tests] -.-> model
    checks -.-> engine
    checks -.-> py
  end
  subgraph proposed[Proposed - not implemented]
    clients[Web and later mobile clients] --> backend[Python API modular monolith]
    backend --> db[Relational user-owned records]
    importer[Permitted data preparation and evaluation] --> db
  end
